# Keep the repository itself in LF, whatever the platform's `core.autocrlf` says.
#
# Templates are the reason this matters here: `skills/setup-dkitchen/render.js` parses the
# `<!-- module: -->` markers and the fenced pointer blocks, and a working tree with CRLF once
# produced files that still carried their markers. The renderer now normalizes on read as well
# — see `normalized()` — so a checkout with CRLF still renders correctly, and this keeps the
# committed text stable either way.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: Git must not touch these.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
